Dear Prof. Wester,

I hope this message finds you well. I am writing to submit an abstract for =
consideration in the upcoming ACA 2024 conference.  My proposed talk is tit=
led "Computing the greatest common divisor of several parametric univariate=
 polynomials via generalized subresultant polynomials".  The full abstract =
document, formatted according to the guidelines provided on the ACA 2024 we=
bsite, can be found in the attachments.

Should you require any further information or have specific questions about=
 the submission, please feel free to contact me.  I look forward to the pos=
sibility of participating in ACA 2024 and contributing to the exchange of k=
nowledge within our field.

Thank you for your time and consideration.

Best regards,
Jing Yang

